{
  "name": "Arms of the Astral Self",
  "type": "feat",
  "_id": "9on9cjAAWk8APGgE",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp",
  "folder": "Y7kYjWahYCHclGWR",
  "sort": 100000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of your Focus lets you summon part of your astral self. As a Bonus Action, you can expend 1 Focus Point to summon its arms. When you do, each creature of your choice you can see within 10 feet of you must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take Force damage equal to two rolls of your Martial Arts die.</p><p>For 10 minutes, the spectral arms hover near your shoulders or surround your arms (your choice of appearance); they vanish early if you have the Incapacitated condition or die. While they are present, you gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li>You can use your Wisdom modifier in place of your Strength modifier for Strength checks and Strength saving throws.</li><li>You can use the spectral arms to make Unarmed Strikes; on your turn, your reach with them is 5 feet greater than normal.</li><li>Unarmed Strikes made with the arms can use your Wisdom modifier in place of Strength or Dexterity for their attack and damage rolls, and they deal Force damage.</li></ul><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gnSzpjrvKaBdPdbE\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll your Strength checks and saves with Wisdom yourself while the arms are present.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
